    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Interventional Radiologist at the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) took the lead by placing the first ever Vena Caval Filter, which is a highly specialized procedure for the first time in Pakistan. AKUH is one of the leading hospitals providing opportunities for higher training, developing skills and creating environment for such sophisticated procedures.",
